{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_438","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/sh -lc \"sed -n '30,145p' /workspace/AEP_TOOLS.md\"","aggregated_output":"## RFC-0005：Grounded Semantic Operation Discovery\n\n本 binary 在 OFF 基础上新增三个发现入口（全部 read-only）：\n\n### `resolve_entity`\n\n```text\nresolve_entity name=<name> [kind=<module|function|type|record|enum>] [module=<模块名>]\n→ {\"entity\": <EntityId>, \"kind\": ..., \"module\": ..., \"display\": ...}\n```\n\n- exact-first；歧义返回 `E_AEP_AMBIGUOUS_ENTITY` +\n  `result.candidates`（不静默选一个）；\n- 找不到返回 `E_AEP_ENTITY_NOT_FOUND` + `result.candidates`；\n- `module` 过滤是**精确匹配**；`display` 与实体 id 解析一致。\n\n### `applicable_operations`\n\n```text\napplicable_operations entity=<entity-id|name>\n→ {\"entity\":..., \"kind\":..., \"inspection\":[...], \"mutation\":[...],\n   \"context_operations\":[...]}\n```\n\n- `inspection` / `mutation` = 对该实体**真正适用**的操作（entity scope）；\n- `context_operations` = construction/expression/transaction scope 的\n  上下文操作（不是\"对这个实体\"的操作）；\n- A1 工具默认不可见，绝不在此泄漏。\n\n### `describe_operation`\n\n```text\ndescribe_operation name=<operation>\n→ {\"name\":..., \"aliases\":[...], \"target_kinds\":[...],\n   \"arguments\":[{\"name\",\"shape\",\"required\"}], \"effects\":...,\n   \"example\":..., \"gated\":...}\n```\n\n- `replace_expression` 额外返回 `expected_positions`（完整 position 词表）；\n- 别名（如 `replace_expr`）会被 canonicalize 到正式 operation。\n\n### Structured recovery hints\n\n失败响应的 `result` 是机器可读 payload，不是纯文本：\n\n```json\n{\"requested\":\"...\", \"candidates\":[\"...\", \"...\"]}\n```\n\n```json\n{\"operation\":\"replace_expression\", \"argument\":\"position\",\n \"requested\":\"...\", \"expected_positions\":[\"...\"],\n \"recovery\":{\"tool\":\"describe_operation\", \"name\":\"replace_expression\"}}\n```\n\nhints 是确定性提示，**不会自动执行**相似操作。\n\n## 工具清单（37）\n\n### 只读（13）\n- `resolve_entity` / `applicable_operations` / `describe_operation`（见上）\n- `inspect_project` — 项目 revision 与模块列表\n- `inspect_module name=<模块名>`\n- `inspect_function name=<module.fn>`\n- `inspect_entity entity=<entity-id|name>`\n- `inspect_body function=<module.fn>`\n- `inspect_test module=<模块名> name=<测试名>`\n- `list_candidates hole=<hole-id>`\n- `preview_semantic_diff`\n- `inspect_change_impact entity=<entity-id|name>` — ⚠️ 实验性，默认关闭\n  （`ALVA_AEP_ENABLE_EXPERIMENTAL_A1=1`）\n- `inspect_schema_gaps entity=<entity-id|name>` — ⚠️ 实验性，默认关闭（同上）\n\n### 写入（24）\n- `begin_transaction project=<路径>` / `check_transaction` /\n  `commit_transaction` / `abort_transaction`\n- `create_literal type=<string|i64|bool|bytes|nil> value=<值>`\n- `create_reference name=<符号名>`\n- `create_call name=<qualified fn|builtin> args=<rev> [args=<rev>...]`\n- `create_binding name=<名> type_name=<类型> value=<rev>`\n- `create_block steps=<rev> [steps=<rev>...]`\n- `create_if cond=<rev> then=<rev> else=<rev>`\n- `create_binary op=<==|+|...> left=<rev> right=<rev>`\n- `create_query kind=<contains|any|all|find> collection=<rev> [target=]\n  [elem_var=] [predicate=]`\n- `append_step function=<module.fn> step=<rev>`\n- `replace_expression parent=<rev> child=<rev> position=<slot>`（别名\n  `replace_expr`）\n- `add_function module=<模块名> name=<名> returns=<类型> [params=...]`\n- `change_field entity=<rev> field=<字段名> value=<值>`\n- `rename_entity entity=<entity-id|name> new_name=<新名>`\n- `add_field type=<类型名> name=<字段名> type_name=<类型>`\n- `add_record_field record=<rev> name=<字段名> value=<rev>`\n- `add_param function=<module.fn> name=<名> type=<类型>`\n- `add_call_arg call=<rev> arg=<rev>`\n- `set_effect function=<module.fn> effect=<pure|io>`\n- `add_cap module=<模块名> cap=<io|clock|unsafe-ffi>`\n- `update_record_fields type=<record 类型> base=<rev> updates={field:<rev>...}`\n\n### replace_expression position\n\n`position` 是 kind 相关的友好槽位名（非 `steps/N` / `args/N`）；完整词表见\n`describe_operation name=replace_expression` 的 `expected_positions`：\n\n```text\nvalue body cond then else left right step arg collection predicate\nstart end init cond2 catch scrutinee range_start range_end acc_init\n```\n\n传错 position 返回 `E_AEP_OP: invalid position`，`result.expected_positions`\n是该父节点 kind 真正接受的列表。\n\n## 重要语义\n\n- revision 参数支持唯一短前缀与实体名；写操作命中已失效 revision 自动映射到\n  该实体最新 head；\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
